Enal AI OS now has a complete Product Intelligence stack: telemetry event collection, JSONL metrics collector, KPI aggregation service, async benchmark runner with concurrency control, capability score evaluation with per-dimension breakdown, golden expected results, CCE runner with regression detection, trend analysis, confidence calibration, and HTML report generation.

### Allowed Changes

- Bug fix
- Security fix
- Performance improvement
- Benchmark / telemetry improvements
- Capability score calibration
- ADR-approved cross-capability changes

### Prohibited Without ADR

- Runtime v2
- Planner v2
- Kernel v2
- Conversation v2
- Worker v2
- Any new layer
- Large refactors without cross-domain need

### Post-Baseline Phase

- Capability Excellence
- Continuous Capability Evaluation (CCE)
- Dogfooding (30 days)
- Developer Preview
- Capability Baseline v1.0.0-dev
- v1.0.0 Stable

### Philosophy

Core evolves only when at least two Capability Packs prove the same cross-domain need. Every change must be validated through benchmark and telemetry.
